msgid "`Key#fingerprint([algorithm = 'sha256'[, hashType = 'ssh']])`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/sshpk_README.md:182
msgid "Creates a new `Fingerprint` object representing this Key's fingerprint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/sshpk_README.md:186
msgid ""
"`algorithm` -- String name of hash algorithm to use, valid options are "
"`md5`,                `sha1`, `sha256`, `sha384`, `sha512`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/sshpk_README.md:188
msgid ""
"`hashType` -- String name of fingerprint hash type to use, valid options "
